          {
            "id": "b",
            "label": "₹6"
          },
          {
            "id": "c",
            "label": "₹9"
          },
          {
            "id": "d",
            "label": "₹12"
          }
        ]
      },
      "content": {
        "text": "2 pens and 3 pencils cost ₹39. One pen and one pencil cost ₹15. What is one pen?",
