      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Heads-and-legs questions become easy with a baseline.\n\nIf all animals had 2 legs, H heads would give 2H legs. Every 4-legged animal contributes 2 extra legs.\n\nExtra legs ÷ 2 = number of 4-legged animals.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
